{"2801700": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "HYPER DEMON PVP", "steam_appid": 2801700, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>HYPER DEMON PVP is a free online 1v1 FPS.</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master your movement, aim, timing and resources to defeat your opponents in intense duels. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With precise lasers and powerful charge shots, damage your opponent to grow their weak point. Hit the weak point to defeat them instantly. Defeat them 3 times to win the match. Use your recharging shield to avoid damage and reflect projectiles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compete on the global leaderboard.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create private lobbies to challenge your friends. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Watch replays and spectate other players to improve. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Study the tutorials and practice with a CPU opponent while waiting for the next match to start. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1v1-only allows for a unique server architecture. Each match will use the server with the best ping for both players.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Originally a secret easter egg in HYPER DEMON, PVP is now expanded and available free for everyone. Enjoy responsibly.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>HYPER DEMON PVP is a free online 1v1 FPS.</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master your movement, aim, timing and resources to defeat your opponents in intense duels. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With precise lasers and powerful charge shots, damage your opponent to grow their weak point. Hit the weak point to defeat them instantly. Defeat them 3 times to win the match. Use your recharging shield to avoid damage and reflect projectiles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compete on the global leaderboard.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create private lobbies to challenge your friends. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Watch replays and spectate other players to improve. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Study the tutorials and practice with a CPU opponent while waiting for the next match to start. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1v1-only allows for a unique server architecture. Each match will use the server with the best ping for both players.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Originally a secret easter egg in HYPER DEMON, PVP is now expanded and available free for everyone. Enjoy responsibly.</p>", "short_description": "HYPER DEMON PVP is a free online 1v1 FPS. Master simple but deep mechanics and defeat opponents in intense duels to climb the global leaderboard.", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2801700/82b4614a2276c0f23273003fbd3662cf2aac18a4/header.jpg?t=1762336440", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2801700/e318130c9271fad2d725a7cc844183c9971b9e1b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1762336440", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2801700/e318130c9271fad2d725a7cc844183c9971b9e1b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1762336440", "website": "https://hyprd.mn/pvp", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 2.0 GHz dual core or better<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<b